# Cross-machine sync (meetmap-desktop)

This repo is synced **together with meetmap** via GitHub. Run all sync commands from **meetmap** root, or use the npm scripts here (they delegate to meetmap).

## Agent behavior

Same as meetmap `.cursor/rules/cross-machine-sync.mdc`:

- **Session start:** `npm run sync:pull` (from this folder or meetmap)
- **Switching machines / done:** ensure commits exist, then `npm run sync:push`

## Paths

| Machine | meetmap-desktop (this repo) |
|---------|------------------------------|
| Windows | `C:\Users\areil\Documents\meetmap-desktop\meetmap-desktop` |
| Mac | `~/Documents/meetmap-desktop/meetmap-desktop` |

Full docs: `meetmap/docs/CROSS_MACHINE_SYNC.md`
